<title>USA: ESS Technology sees pressure on Q2 margins.</title>
<headline>ESS Technology sees pressure on Q2 margins.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ESS Technology Inc Wednesday said increasing pricing pressure in the audio and video markets reduced first quater gross margins to about 49 percent and is expected to result in continued downward pressure on margins in the second quarter until new products are shipping in volume.</p>
<p>The company also said its backlog remains strong and its first quarter book-to-bill ratio remained above one.</p>
</text>
